 - Not populated for passthrough vertex generation (`translate_passthrough`).
 - Ordinary descriptor-backed texture nullness remains fixed at translation time; serialized
   argument-buffer tokens can be checked at run time — see *Nil texture bindings*.
+
+Reflection 66 adds `argument_buffer_roots`: sorted unique Metal buffer indices explicitly
+declared by AIR `air.indirect_buffer`. These survive opaque nested graph lowering even when
+`argument_buffer_fields` is empty. Each root must match a reflected entry buffer; ordinary
+storage buffers are not inferred to be roots. Runtime scanning uses existing typed spans when
+available and a conservative root span otherwise. Table ABI 9 and descriptor numbers are
+unchanged; reflection 65 remains readable without the new field. Native cache identities
+must change so old translations that lost roots are regenerated.
